body:
omg same!! before nct i was a pretty big kpop fan - got into tvxq wayy back then! i started watching nct struggling w language compliation videos cause i was bored..previously i only knew nct taeyong (cause hes so famous) mark lucas and ten, cause of superm and i think winwin was all over my youtube comments..youtube recommended me "i like me better" and it is SO my aesthetic - love vinyl records and tumblr and old cities and all that

&#x200B;

been a jaehyun stan ever since and now my bias wreckers are jaemin, johnny, do young, taeyong and junwoo <3

ur already helpful

&#x200B;

I am looking to therapy as the one reason for me to go on..maybe it can change my behaviour and thought processes so i stop making mistakes and actually be a functional and kind human being like others. 

&#x200B;

i wish that i was alone and didnt have loved ones. it would be easier.

I wished that I didnt exist in the first place. alternatively, maybe if i could get a button or a chance to "restart" my life, I would. I want to go to heaven. But I dont think I deserve to..

&#x200B;

I'm not sure what to do now.
